@startuml BudgetDarpanDocumentIngestion
!include _theme.puml
title Budget Darpan — Document Ingestion and OCR Pipeline
caption Original files are preserved; only accepted page text is indexed

start
:Register source from datasets/manifest.csv;
:Create SourceDocument with municipality,\nfiscal year, type, language and source URL;
:Save original file and SHA-256;

repeat
  :Open next page with PyMuPDF;
  :Try embedded text extraction;
  if (Usable text layer?) then (yes)
    :Store embedded text;
    :Calculate text quality score;
  else (no)
    :Render page through Poppler;
    :OCR with Tesseract nep+eng;
    :Store OCR confidence and warnings;
  endif

  if (Quality above acceptance threshold?) then (yes)
    :Mark page AUTO_ACCEPTED;
  else (no)
    :Mark page REVIEW_REQUIRED;
  endif
  :Preserve page number, section, method,\ncharacter count and extraction metadata;
repeat while (More pages?) is (yes)

:Complete DataExtractionRecord;
if (Important page approved/accepted?) then (yes)
  :Create overlapping page-level chunks;
  :Attach project relationship and page range;
  :Generate multilingual document embedding;
  :Upsert to configured vector provider;
else (no)
  :Keep original for human review;
  :Do not index rejected/pending evidence;
endif

:Document becomes available through\nsource library and citation viewer;
stop

note right
  Failure behavior:
  • preserve original file
  • mark extraction failed
  • show understandable status
  • never flatten the PDF into anonymous text
end note
@enduml
